{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13692","headline":"上古之什补亡训传十三章 · 顾况","name":"上古之什补亡训传十三章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陵霜之华，我心忧嗟。\n阴之胜矣，而阳不加。\n坱轧陶钧，乃帝乃神。\n乃舒乃屯，烈烈严秋。\n熙熙阳春，职生有伦。\n今华发非其辰，辰属东方之仁。\n遐想三五，黄帝登云。\n尧年百余，二仪分位。\n六气不渝，二景如璧，五星如珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}